<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were mostly steady.  Demand was light to moderate on a moderate movement. Top $57.25 per  cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>				  Country			  Plant</p>
<p>US 1-2   230-260 LBS.  55.00-56.00 Few 56.50	55.50-57.25</p>
<p>US 2-3   230-260 LBS.  50.50-54.50</p>
<p>	   210-230 LBS.  45.50-50.50</p>
<p>Sows:  Near steady. Top 48.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-500 LBS.  41.00-44.50</p>
<p>	   500-600 LBS.  44.50-47.00</p>
<p>Few over 600 lbs.  47.00-48.50</p>
